{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20228",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 4.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Sorry, you know, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.7,
      "end_seconds": 11.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "So, no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.12,
      "end_seconds": 13.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "I've been feeling low"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.73,
      "end_seconds": 21.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list? I ask cos it helps me narrow things down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.78,
      "end_seconds": 28.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "I take fluoxetine, 20 milligrams, every morning for my mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.61,
      "end_seconds": 30.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.89,
      "end_seconds": 38.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Uh, around two months... no wait, it's more like about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.9,
      "end_seconds": 42.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "So, what brings it on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.07,
      "end_seconds": 48.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Yes, uh, work pressure. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.27,
      "end_seconds": 52.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.7,
      "end_seconds": 57.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.21,
      "end_seconds": 61.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "what do you do to make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.47,
      "end_seconds": 68.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "It settles a little with talking to a friend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.23,
      "end_seconds": 71.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Right, is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.75,
      "end_seconds": 83.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "No energy goes along with it, most of the time. The No energy? That's been for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.54,
      "end_seconds": 85.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.91,
      "end_seconds": 104.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Did you get thoughts of harming myself or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.46,
      "end_seconds": 109.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "No, no thoughts of harming myself or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.72,
      "end_seconds": 116.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain or panic attacks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.31,
      "end_seconds": 119.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.04,
      "end_seconds": 123.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.17,
      "end_seconds": 127.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Mm, no, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.57,
      "end_seconds": 139.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Okay, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.67,
      "end_seconds": 142.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "no surgery, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.16,
      "end_seconds": 147.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.2,
      "end_seconds": 151.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "actually, my brother has epilepsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.0,
      "end_seconds": 171.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.65,
      "end_seconds": 175.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I'm allergic to diclofenac, I get wheezing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.72,
      "end_seconds": 177.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.92,
      "end_seconds": 184.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.6,
      "end_seconds": 186.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.84,
      "end_seconds": 192.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.49,
      "end_seconds": 196.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.14,
      "end_seconds": 202.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.77,
      "end_seconds": 205.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.19,
      "end_seconds": 211.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.27,
      "end_seconds": 217.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Alright, has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.21,
      "end_seconds": 220.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I've had depression, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.4,
      "end_seconds": 226.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.82,
      "end_seconds": 242.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.0,
      "end_seconds": 268.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, pulse 86, blood pressure 115 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.95,
      "end_seconds": 271.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.92,
      "end_seconds": 275.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.87,
      "end_seconds": 281.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.29,
      "end_seconds": 283.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.11,
      "end_seconds": 306.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "Your pulse and blood pressure are normal and you are tearful when talking about work."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.7,
      "end_seconds": 309.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.16,
      "end_seconds": 327.45,
      "duration_seconds": 14.29,
      "text": "right, that's all I needed to check okay, thinking it through, I don't have a clear answer today: low mood linked to work stress is possible, and so is an anxiety disorder"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.52,
      "end_seconds": 374.36,
      "duration_seconds": 32.84,
      "text": "A blood count is what I'd like next, for fatigue. A thyroid test is what I'd like next, for low mood and fatigue. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Try a short walk each day and keep a regular bedtime. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. Let's get you seen by the talking therapies service, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.22,
      "end_seconds": 376.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.14,
      "end_seconds": 384.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: you have thoughts of harming yourself. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.53,
      "end_seconds": 387.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.29,
      "end_seconds": 397.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "Please come and and see me in two weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.61,
      "end_seconds": 402.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.27,
      "end_seconds": 404.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}